{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1950,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:hypersurface-volume-form","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-formula]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-unit-normal-field]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:induced-orientation-characterization]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form","line":3131,"source":"\\begin{proposition}\n\\label{prop:hypersurface-volume-form}\n\n\\uses{prop:hypersurface-volume-form-formula, prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced, prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if, prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if, prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal, prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth, def:induced-orientation, def:smooth-unit-normal-field, def:unit-normal, def:interior-multiplication, lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame, lem:induced-orientation-characterization}\n\n\\dcref{ch2:2.43}\n\n\n\nFor $n\\ge1$, an isometric hypersurface immersion into an oriented Riemannian $(n+1)$-manifold is orientable iff it admits a smooth global unit normal field.\n\\end{proposition}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if,prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if,prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal,prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth,def:induced-orientation,def:smooth-unit-normal-field}\n\\sketch A smooth normal gives a smooth induced orientation by Proposition \\ref{prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal}; a smooth orientation gives a smooth determined normal by Proposition \\ref{prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth}. In either direction equation (2.17) holds for the corresponding orientation and normal.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section> <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a6879706572737572666163652d766f6c756d652d666f726d\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-volume-form-formula\">↗ prop:hypersurface-volume-form-formula</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-volume-form-induced\">↗ prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-volume-form-if\">↗ prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-volume-form-only-if\">↗ prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-orientable-of-normal\">↗ prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aunit-normal-of-orientation-smooth\">↗ prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-orientation\">↗ def:induced-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-unit-normal-field\">↗ def:smooth-unit-normal-field</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Aunit-normal\">↗ def:unit-normal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainterior-multiplication\">↗ def:interior-multiplication</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anormal-space-orthonormal-frame\">↗ lem:normal-space-orthonormal-frame</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ainduced-orientation-characterization\">↗ lem:induced-orientation-characterization</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch2:2.43</span></span><p></p>For <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n\\ge 1$\">$n\\ge 1$</span>, an isometric hypersurface immersion into an oriented Riemannian <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(n+1)$\">$(n+1)$</span>-manifold is orientable iff it admits a smooth global unit normal field.  <p></p><section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-volume-form-if\">↗ prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-volume-form-only-if\">↗ prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-orientable-of-normal\">↗ prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aunit-normal-of-orientation-smooth\">↗ prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-orientation\">↗ def:induced-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-unit-normal-field\">↗ def:smooth-unit-normal-field</a> \\sketch A smooth normal gives a smooth induced orientation by Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Ahypersurface-orientable-of-normal\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a6879706572737572666163652d6f7269656e7461626c652d6f662d6e6f726d616c\">8</a>; a smooth orientation gives a smooth determined normal by Proposition <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aunit-normal-of-orientation-smooth\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-70726f703a756e69742d6e6f726d616c2d6f662d6f7269656e746174696f6e2d736d6f6f7468\">8</a>. In either direction equation (2.17) holds for the corresponding orientation and normal. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:density-vector-space","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-formula","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-formula","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-formula"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-induced"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-only-if"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal","title":"prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal","label":"prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth","title":"prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth","label":"prop:unit-normal-of-orientation-smooth"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation","title":"def:induced-orientation","label":"def:induced-orienta